```cpp
#include <iostream>

int main() {
    std::cout << "Hello, World!" << std::endl;
    return 0;
}
```

### Key Components:
1. `#include <iostream>` - Header for input/output operations
2. `int main()` - Entry point of every C++ program
3. `std::cout` - Standard output stream
4. `<<` - Stream insertion operator
5. `std::endl` - End line (flushes the buffer)

